<HelpTab>
    <HelpSection Title="Getting everyone set up at once">
        <FluentText>
            Managers and admins see <strong>Share this page with your team</strong> at the bottom of Get Started.
            Select <strong>Copy link</strong>, turn the link into a QR code and put it on screen. Each person scans
            it, signs in and lands on Get Started on their own phone.
        </FluentText>
        <HelpNote>
            On iPhone, people need to add the app to their Home Screen, open it from there, and then scan the code
            again to turn on notifications. Leave the code on screen for a few minutes.
        </HelpNote>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Seeing who's done it">
        <FluentText>
            Managers and admins can open <strong>Management › People › Staff Set-up</strong> to see who at their
            location has the app and notifications on, and chase anyone who hasn't.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="New starters">
        <FluentText>
            When someone you invite sets their password, <strong>Continue to Login</strong> signs them in and takes them straight to Get Started.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
